00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:11.070
So I'm hoping we can get
the rest of them done.

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:14.760
I think we should get all the mini
stories completed at LingQ in those

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:19.440
languages where they aren't complete,
but it's also an example of how  we

00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:20.610
