00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:24.820
And if along the way, while I'm doing
my Arabic, I'm attracted by Danish

00:05:24.930 --> 00:05:28.230
or as happened with Turkish, I'm
doing Arabic and Persian and then my

00:05:28.230 --> 00:05:29.790
