00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:32.910
So I go in and learn a little
bit of Turkish and I'll probably

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:34.170
do that again at some point.

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:38.490
Uh, so that's kind of the
way my week's been going.

00:05:38.970 --> 00:05:41.940
And the typically I'll get on
my stepper and listen to one

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.950
